[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_FUEL_TANK]
Fuel Tank

[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_FUEL_TANK_desc]
For thousands of years, Equestria vehicles have never ever felt the need to tie an highly explosive object to the back. But thanks to the advent of the internal combustion engine, our tank is finally dangerous enough.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_FUEL_TANK]
油箱

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_FUEL_TANK_desc]
几千年来，小马利亚的车辆从未有过将高度爆炸性的物体绑在后面的需求。但多亏了内燃机的出现，我们的坦克终于够危险了。
